## Preferred Dependencies

| Usage | Dépendance | Alternative interdite |
|-------|------------|------------------------|
| Animations | `motion` | framer-motion (ancien nom) |
| Routing | `react-router-dom` | wouter, reach-router |
| State | `zustand` | Redux, MobX, Context API |
| Icons | `lucide-react` | react-icons, font-awesome |
| Charts | `recharts` | chart.js, d3 (sauf cas complexe) |
| Markdown | `react-markdown` | html-react-parser |
| CSV | `papaparse` | csv-parser côté client |
| QR Code | `qrcode.react` | qrcode.js |

